  "title": "Rhubarb Dum Dum",
  "description": "This rhubarb dum dum recipe layers fresh rhubarb over a simple cake batter sprinkled with a bit of cinnamon to make an easy, not too sweet summer dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "mama of four"
  ],
